},"How well do you understand accessibility and consistency guidelines within the Design System?":{"rating":5},"How actively do you contribute feedback or improvements to Design System assets?":{"rating":4},"How consistently do you create complete documentation to support design handoffs?":{"rating":4},"How clearly do your documentation artifacts communicate design intent, decisions, and requirements?":{"rating":5},"How effectively do you maintain artifacts such as FigJam boards, process flows, and supporting documentation?":{"rating":4},"How easy would it be for another designer or engineer to continue your work using your documentation?":{"rating":4},"How comfortable are you presenting your work to Product Managers, Engineers, and UX Leads?":{"rating":5},"How proactively do you engage key stakeholders throughout the design process?":{"rating":4},"How effectively do you incorporate cross-functional feedback into your design decisions?":{"rating":4},"How comfortable are you co-facilitating workshops, discovery sessions, or readouts?":{"rating":5},"How consistently do you communicate project updates through Teams, channels, or project forums?":{"rating":4},"How actively do you invest in developing new UX skills and knowledge?":{"rating":4},"How comfortable are you sharing knowledge through presentations, demos, or learning sessions?":{"rating":5},"How often do you apply learning from courses, workshops, or coaching sessions to real project work?":{"rating":4},"How prepared do you feel for your next career step?":{"rating":4}}'::jsonb,
